{"4247460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Home", "steam_appid": 4247460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>The Home: Story Mode</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guilt</strong> has led you to break back into your old, abandoned care home. As you tread through the overgrown hallways, memories of your days as a child appear as if you are still there. You know something is following you. But the question is... is it just in your head? Trek through your trauma as you discover the fate of Mr Blackwood, the abusive manager of the home. As you progress, your childhood invades the present while you relive those traumatic memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>The Home: Recollections</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work 5 nightshifts and perform 4 different tasks, to complete your trial week at Willow Wood Children's Care Home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to crawl through the attic, hide the truth from inspectors and face your<i> </i><strong>Guilt</strong> head on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will retrace your first week as a carer at Willow Wood. The most important thing to remember is <strong>never</strong> go into the basement! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do you want to remember?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play all 'The Home' games free on Steam via the DLCs.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>The Home: Story Mode</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guilt</strong> has led you to break back into your old, abandoned care home. As you tread through the overgrown hallways, memories of your days as a child appear as if you are still there. You know something is following you. But the question is... is it just in your head? Trek through your trauma as you discover the fate of Mr Blackwood, the abusive manager of the home. As you progress, your childhood invades the present while you relive those traumatic memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>The Home: Recollections</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work 5 nightshifts and perform 4 different tasks, to complete your trial week at Willow Wood Children's Care Home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to crawl through the attic, hide the truth from inspectors and face your<i> </i><strong>Guilt</strong> head on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will retrace your first week as a carer at Willow Wood. The most important thing to remember is <strong>never</strong> go into the basement! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do you want to remember?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play all 'The Home' games free on Steam via the DLCs.</p>", "short_description": "The Home is a series of games inspired by real-life stories from children's care homes. These games have captured the disgusting truth and vile horror of the care system. Dive into the (unfortunately) accurate world of THE HOME.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247460/ea65f2392cd5ef9cfdd9af724fd6540127c2f589/header.jpg?t=1783458138", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247460/81ff7d8bde03be51abec792413bd3f016a6a4179/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783458138", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247460/81ff7d8bde03be51abec792413bd3f016a6a4179/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783458138", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM